andex.ru номер заказа и опишите ситуацию — проверим\",[1787481800,917000000]],null,[\"102703137508145027058\",\"Inna Gunko\",null,[[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXbw2DnFYdDqCOzYO8wJ9jNK35X08oYKeu8qNKPZvQycDywI7RD\"]],true],[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Yq7oyNIvAAkuc69fG51sbAQS4otJxbObbt3xdr8tXxXyUdq4tVGtfgeKuptveGdP1srxaHVrNPzOYcfaEQ\"]]],\"5.91.2\",null,null,null,null,null,1],[\"d471aa29-c8c8-4c41-be7b-23330279776e\",[\"Ирина Карпечина\",[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJR2P6UY-ruSXn_nCeAFvh77e7hgWhElbo_92jHsAeIMvLNZA\\u003dmo\"]]],5,null,\"все хорошо\",[1787481486,527000000],0,null,null,[\"116125052548634604214\",\"Ирина Карпечина\",null,[[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJR2P6UY-ruSXn_nCeAFvh77e7hgWhElbo_92jHsAeIMvLNZA\\u003dmo\"]],true],[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Yq7oyNIvAAkuc69fG51sbAQS4otJxbObbt3xdr8tXxXyUdq4tVGtfgeKuptveGdP1srxaHVrNPzOYcfaEQ\"]]],\"5.91.2\",null,null,null,null,null,1],[\"92fdbb99-c05d-4dff-bb0f-75d4dc7ed1af\",[\"Виктор Гюго\",[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJkOL9I7cpfjTSR1HmSr1qiqqgU5RVv2sWFrAlsqlNq0lB2sw\\u003dmo\"]]],5,null,\"Вежливый и аккуратный водитель.\",[1787481333,27000000],0,null,null,[\"110180678770374164195\",\"Виктор Гюго\",null,[[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJkOL9I7cpfjTSR1HmSr1qiqqgU5RVv2sWFrAlsqlNq0lB2sw\\u003dmo\"]],true],[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Yq7oyNIvAAkuc69fG51sbAQS4otJxbObbt3xdr8tXxXyUdq4tVGtfgeKuptveGdP1srxaHVrNPzOYcfaEQ\"]]],\"5.91.2\",null,null,null,null,null,1],[\"e36edec2-bd32-48df-9264-3238a8241ee8\",[\"Евгения Дмитренко\",[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIx2MUwf14LB2YmaGuIjoFrqfmNtIvtwDs8o7ZLXaI2SQDMnA\\u003dmo\"]]],5,null,\"Спасибо. Всё отлично.\",[1787480914,401000000